thoughts.description:
I'm now drafting the `style.css` file from scratch, focusing on the updated layout. I'm removing old classes like `.sidebar-drawer`, `.overlay`, and `.main`, and creating fresh styles for the new grid and flexbox structure. Specifically, I'm setting `flex: 1` on the response tab content to allow it to fill the available height correctly. I'm also preparing for the request textarea adjustments.

```css
/* General Styles */
body {
  font-family: sans-serif;
  margin: 0;
  height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden; /* Prevent scrollbar for the body */
  background-color: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

:root {
  --bg: #f4f4f4; /* Light Mode Background */
  --text: #333; /* Light Mode Text */
  --bg-alt: #e9e9e9; /* Light Mode Alternate Background */
  --border: #ccc;
  --primary: #007bff; /* Primary Color */
  --secondary: #6c757d; /* Secondary Color */
}

/* Dark Mode Variables */
.dark-mode {
  --bg: #222; /* Dark Mode Background */
  --text: #f4f4f4; /* Dark Mode Text */
  --bg-alt: #333; /* Dark Mode Alternate Background */
  --border: #555;
}

/* Header */
header {
  background-color: var(--bg-alt);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Header Buttons */
header button {
  background-color: var(--primary);
  color: white;
  border: none;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-radius: 4px;
  margin-left: 10px;
}

/* Main Layout (Using Flexbox for Column Layout) */
.app {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1; /* Take up remaining vertical space */
  overflow: hidden; /* Hide horizontal scrollbar, if any */
}

/* Left Sidebar */
.left-sidebar {
  width: 20%;
  background-color: var(--bg-alt);
  border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 10px;
  box-sizing: border-box; /* Include padding/border in element's total width */
  overflow-y: auto; /* Enable vertical scrolling */
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Middle Content */
.middle-content {
  flex: 1; /* Take up remaining horizontal space */
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column; /* Stack sections vertically */
  overflow: hidden; /* Hide horizontal scrollbar, if any */
}

/* Right Sidebar */
.right-sidebar {
  width: 20%;
  background-color: var(--bg-alt);
  border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 10px;
  box-sizing: border-box; /* Include padding/border in element's total width */
  overflow-y: auto; /* Enable vertical scrolling */
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Request Section (Top 40% of Middle Content) */
.request-section {
  padding: 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  overflow-y: auto;
  flex-direction: column;
  display: flex;
  flex-shrink: 0; /* Prevent the request section from shrinking */
}

/* Response Section (Bottom 60% of Middle Content) */
.response-section {
  padding: 10px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  flex: 1; /* Take up remaining vertical space within middle-content */
  flex-direction: column;
  display: flex;
}

/* Tabs */
.tabs {
  display: flex;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.

args.content:
/* MINIMALIST OVERRIDES & ADAPTATIONS */
:root {
  --bg: var(--bg-primary);
  --bg-alt: var(--bg-secondary);
  --border: var(--border-default);
  --text: var(--text-primary);
  --text-secondary: var(--text-secondary);
  --text-muted: var(--text-muted);

  --primary: var(--accent);
  --primary-hover: var(--accent-hover);
  --success: var(--success);
  --error: var(--error);
  --warning: var(--warning);

  --color-get: var(--method-get);
  --color-post: var(--method-post);
  --color-put: var(--method-put);
  --color-patch: var(--method-patch);
  --color-delete: var(--method-delete);

  --radius: 8px;
  --transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.5;
  overflow: hidden;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

/* LAYOUT & GRID */
.app {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100vh;
  width: 100vw;
  background: var(--bg);
}

.header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--bg);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.layout-container {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
}

.left-sidebar {
  width: 20%;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: var(--bg-alt);
}

.middle-content {
  width: 60%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: var(--bg);
}

.right-sidebar {
  width: 20%;
  border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: var(--bg-alt);
}

.request-section {
  height: 40%;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 20px 24px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.response-section {
  height: 60%;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: var(--bg-alt);
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* COMPONENTS */
.brand {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}
.brand span { color: var(--primary); }

.nav-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; }

button {
  background: var(--bg-alt);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: var(--transition);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
button:hover { background: var(--border); color: var(--text); }
button.primary { background: var(--primary); border-color: var(--primary); color: white; }
button.primary:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); border-color: var(--primary-hover); }
button.ghost { background: transparent; border-color: transparent; }
button.ghost:hover { background: var(--bg-alt); }

.request-bar {
  display: flex;
  background: var(--bg-alt);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 4px;
  gap: 4px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  transition: var(--transition);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.request-bar:focus-within { border-color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1); }
.method-select {
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: var(--text);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 13px;
  padding: 0 12px;
  cursor: pointer;
  outline: none;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.url-input {
  flex: 1;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 15px;
  padding: 8px 4px;
  outline: none;
}

.tabs {
  display: flex;
  gap: 24px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.tab {
  padding: 8px 4px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  cursor: pointer;
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  margin-bottom: -1px;
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.tab.active { color: var(--primary); border-bottom-color: var(--primary); }

.request-section .tab-content { display: none; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; }
.request-section .tab-content.active { display: flex; }

.kv-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.kv-row input {
  flex: 1;
  background: var(--bg-alt);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-size: 13px;
  outline: none;
}
.kv-row input:focus { border-color: var(--primary); }

.panel-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.meta-group { display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; }
.status-pill { font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; }
.status-ok { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1); color: var(--success); }
.status-err { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); color: var(--error); }

.response-section .tab-content { display: none; flex: 1; min-height: 0; flex-direction: column; }
.response-section .tab-content.active { display: flex; }

pre {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 16px;
  background: var(--bg);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
  font-size: 13px;
  overflow: auto;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  flex: 1;
}

textarea {
  width: 100%;
  flex: 1;
  background: var(--bg-alt);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 16px;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-family: monospace;
  outline: none;
  resize: none;
}

/* SIDEBARS */
.sidebar-header {
  padding: 16px 20px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}
.sidebar-tabs {
  display: flex;
  padding: 0 20px 12px;
  gap: 4px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.sidebar-tab {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 6px;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.sidebar-tab.active { background: var(--bg); color: var(--primary); }
.sidebar-body { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 12px; }

.list-item {
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.list-item:hover { background: var(--bg); }
.list-item .method { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; min-width: 45px; }
.list-item .url { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; }

#toast {
  position: fixed; bottom: 24px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(100px);
  background: var(--text); color: var(--bg); padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 50px;
  font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); z-index: 1000;
}
#toast.show { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }

.theme-switch {
  position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; gap: 8px; padding: 4px;
}
.switch-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; }
.switch-track {
  position: relative; width: 36px; height: 20px; background: var(--bg-alt);
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; transition: var(--transition);
}
.switch-track::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 2px; width: 14px; height: 14px;
  background: var(--text-muted); border-radius: 50%; transition: var(--transition);
}
[data-mode="dark"] .switch-track { background: var(--primary); border-color: var(--primary); }
[data-mode="dark"] .switch-track::after { left: 18px; background: white; }

.hidden { display: none !important; }

